# Go sources stay LF on every OS (gofmt in CI on Windows runners with autocrlf).
*.go text eol=lf
go.mod text eol=lf
go.sum text eol=lf
# Web assets, catalogs and docs are LF too (they were all LF until 2.2.0).
*.js text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.syso binary
*.ico binary
*.png binary
